  "description": "A failure while a request is being sent, by kind: connect_error, connect_timeout and pool_timeout (nothing reached the server), read_timeout, write_timeout, connection_reset, remote_protocol_error, decoding_error (the request may have been executed), hook_exception (a non-SDK exception raised by the caller's own HTTP event hook or transport), hook_sdk_error (an SDK ServerError raised there) and keyboard_interrupt (passes through unchanged). input.call is place_order, cancel_order, place_gtt, modify_gtt, cancel_gtt (arguments as in outcome_words.json), request_state_changing (request('OrderBook', ..., state_changing=True)) or read (margins()). expected.error is the error type and expected.requests how many requests were sent (a read is retried for NetworkError and RequestTimeoutError: 3 attempts with max_retries 2).",
  "source": "tradesmart._transport.sync_http (map_transport_error, map_unexpected_error) via tradesmart.TradeSmart",
